==Battleground==
*1 [[Mighty Gui Zuli]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemies here are all relatively weak so meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] can easily defend against them. A single [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can destroy these enemies, making the stage much, much easier.

